x666 puts x664 x665
x667 call open x666 11
x668 write x667 2
x669 text "Diagnostics"
x670 puts x668 x669
x671 call close x670 
x672 call open x671 2
x673 write x672 2
x674 text "Every rejection carries a stable code (parse, type, structure, handle, revision, limit), what was expected, what was seen, and the one fix that resolves it. The compiler never guesses: an ambiguous reply is rejected with the fix, not applied approximately."
x675 puts x673 x674
x676 call close x675 
x677 call close x676 
ret x677
end

